OL,3,GNEWSAFatal crash road not fit for
OL,4,Avehicles - campaigner
OL,5,
OL,6,FA resident living near a major road
OL,7,Fwhere there have been 17 deaths in 30
OL,8,Fyears said nothing had been done to
OL,9,Fmake it any safer.
OL,11,FThe A505, between Baldock and Royston
OL,12,Fin Hertfordshire, has also seen 250
OL,13,Fserious injuries or casualties between
OL,14,F1994 and 2024.
OL,16,FLynsey Langdon said her husband was
OL,17,F"still living with the pain every day"
OL,18,Fafter being involved in a crash on the
OL,19,F70mph stretch of dual carriageway,
OL,20,Fwhich has numerous crossing points.
